title: "CHerakoi"
type: software
description: "Pure-frontend (vanilla HTML/CSS/JS) sonification of XRF cubes (HDF5/.npz, xrfraw OME-TIFF, xrfraw FITS): spatial map + per-pixel spectrum mapped to audio, with MediaPipe hand tracking or mouse test mode."
authors:
  - name: "Alessandro Bombini"
version: 0.1.4
date-released: 2026-11-26
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/cherakoi/cherakoi.github.io"
url: "https://github.com/cherakoi/cherakoi.github.io"
keywords:
  - x-ray-fluorescence
  - xrf
  - sonification
  - audio-visualization
  - scientific-visualization